gin="00:24.490" end="00:24.840"> night</span><span begin="00:24.930" end="00:25.220"> ends</span><span begin="00:25.310" end="00:25.450"> up</span><span begin="00:25.490" end="00:25.570"> in</span><span begin="00:25.600" end="00:26.690"> tears</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.690" end="00:31.830"><span begin="00:26.690" end="00:26.970">Wake</span><span begin="00:27.030" end="00:27.110"> up</span><span begin="00:27.140" end="00:27.340"> and</span><span begin="00:27.390" end="00:27.550"> we</span><span begin="00:27.640" end="00:28.020"> blame</span><span begin="00:28.130" end="00:28.300"> it</span><span begin="00:28.390" end="00:28.610"> all</span><span begin="00:28.690" end="00:28.840"> on</span><span begin="00:28.920" end="00:29.300"> being</span><span begin="00:29.370" end="00:30.870"> wasted</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.830" end="00:38.800"><span begin="00:31.830" end="00:32.310">Oh,</span><span begin="00:32.570" end="00:35.240"> this</span><span begin="00:35.300" end="00:35.580"> love</span><span begin="00:35.700" end="00:35.990"> is</span><span begin="00:36.090" end="00:37.590"> fadin'</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.800" end="00:45.060"><span begin="00:38.800" end="00:40.140">So</span><span begin="00:41.050" end="00:41.450"> much</span><span begin="00:41.650" end="00:42.210"> we're</span><span begin="00:42.330" end="00:42.810"> not</span><span begin="00:43.030" end="00:44.530"> sayin'</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.060" end="00:47.790"><span begin="00:45.060" end="00:45.230">But</span><span begin="00:45.280" end="00:45.410"> if</span><span begin="00:45.450" end="00:45.570"> these</span><span begin="00:45.600" end="00:45.860"> walls</span><span begin="00:46.010" end="00:46.410"> could</span><span begin="00:46.550" end="00:47.790"> talk</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.790" end="00:49.970"><span begin="00:47.790" end="00:48.110">(They'd</span><span begin="00:48.130" end="00:48.430"> say)</span><span begin="00:48.470" end="00:49.970"> "Enough"</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.970" end="00:53.190"><span begin="00:49.970" end="00:50.110">(They'd</span><span begin="00:50.130" end="00:50.210"> say)</span><span begin="00:50.230" end="00:50.600"> "Give</span><span begin="00:50.660" end="00:52.160"> up"</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.190" end="00:55.540"><span begin="00:53.190" end="00:53.640">If</span><span begin="00:53.850" end="00:54.240"> these</span><span begin="00:54.350" end="00:54.690"> walls</span><span begin="00:54.860" end="00:55.350"> could</span><span begin="00:55.410" end="00:55.910"> talk</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.540" end="00:57.400"><span begin="00:55.540" end="00:55.800">(They'd</span><span begin="00:55.830" end="00:56.290"> say)</span><span begin="00:56.330" end="00:56.500"> "You</span><span begin="00:56.550" end="00:57.400"> know"</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.400" end="01:00.310"><span begin="00:57.400" end="00:57.560">(They'd</span><span begin="00:57.580" end="00:57.740"> say)</span><span begin="00:58.300" end="00:58.400"> "You</span><span begin="00:58.420" end="00:59.920"> lost"</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.310" end="01:04.690"><span begin="01:00.310" end="01:00.680">It's</span><span begin="01:00.760" end="01:01.080"> not</span><span begin="01:01.120" end="01:01.850"> supposed</span><span begin="01:01.950" end="01:02.190"> to</span><span begin="01:02.270" end="01:02.400"> hurt</span><span begin="01:02.570" end="01:02.650"> this</span><span begin="01:02.670" end="01:04.170"> much</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.690" end="01:08.610"><span begin="01:04.690" end="01:04.880">Oh,</span><span begin="01:04.940" end="01:05.070"> if</span><span begin="01:05.120" end="01:05.590"> these</span><span begin="01:05.710" end="01:05.980"> walls</span><span begin="01:06.160" end="01:06.440"> could</span><span begin="01:06.540" end="01:08.040"> talk</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.610" end="01:11.120"><span begin="01:08.610" end="01:08.940">They'd</span><span begin="01:08.980" end="01:09.090"> tell</span><span begin="01:09.240" end="01:09.410"> us</span><span begin="01:09.650" end="01:09.850"> to</span><span begin="01:09.960" end="01:10.680"> break</span><span begin="01:10.760" end="01:11.260"> up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.120" end="01:14.900" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background"><span begin="01:11.120" end="01:11.260">(These</span><span begin="01:11.270" end="01:11.560"> walls,</span><span begin="01:11.790" end="01:12.480"> these</span><span begin="01:12.700" end="01:14.200"> walls)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.900" end="01:18.730"><span begin="01:14.900" end="01:15.340">(These</span><span begin="01:15.440" end="01:16.260"> walls)</span><span begin="01:16.320" end="01:16.710"> they'd</span><span begin="01:16.800" end="01:17.100"> tell</span><span begin="01:17.190" end="01:17.380"> us</span><span begin="01:17.580" end="01:17.750"> to</span><span begin="01:17.890" end="01:18.100"> break</span><span begin="01:18.100" end="01:18.730"> up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.730" end="01:22.750" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background"><span begin="01:18.730" end="01:19.050">(These</span><span begin="01:19.100" end="01:20.170"> walls,</span><span begin="01:20.250" end="01:20.500"> these</span><span begin="01:20.640" end="01:22.140"> walls)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.750" end="01:26.200" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background"><span begin="01:22.750" end="01:23.030">(These</span><span begin="01:23.090" end="01:24.220"> walls,</span><span begin="01:24.320" end="01:24.730"> these</span><span begin="01:24.790" end="01:26.200"> walls)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.200" end="01:29.120"><span begin="01:26.200" end="01:26.340">They'd</span><span begin="01:26.380" end="01:26.650"> tell</span><span begin="01:26.760" end="01:26.960"> us,</span><span begin="01:27.040" end="01:27.150"> "Go</span><span begin="01:27.210" end="01:27.320"> and</span><span begin="01:27.390" end="01:27.550"> face</span><span begin="01:27.600" end="01:27.810"> your</span><span begin="01:27.930" end="01:29.120"> fears"</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.120" end="01:33.920"><span begin="01:29.120" end="01:29.380">It's</span><span begin="01:29.400" end="01:29.850"> getting</span><span begin="01:29.950" end="01:30.380"> worse</span><span begin="01:30.420" end="01:30.690"> the</span><span begin="01:30.760" end="01:31.070"> longer</span><span begin="01:31.130" end="01:31.300"> that</span><span begin="01:31.370" end="01:31.470"> we</span><span begin="01:31.480" end="01:31.710"> stay</span><span begin="01:31.840" end="01:33.340"> together</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.920" end="01:36.950"><span begin="01:33.920" end="01:34.120">We</span><span begin="01:34.170" end="01:34.390"> call</span><span begin="01:34.460" end="01:34.650"> it</span><span begin="01:34.770" end="01:35.060"> love,</span><span begin="01:35.150" end="01:35.300"> but</span><span begin="01:35.380" end="01:35.680"> hate</span><span begin="01:35.730" end="01:35.850"> it</span><span begin="01:35.880" end="01:36.950"> here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.950" end="01:41.220"><span begin="01:36.950" end="01:37.220">Did</span><span begin="01:37.300" end="01:37.480"> we</span><span begin="01:37.600" end="01:38.000"> really</span><span begin="01:38.060" end="01:38.450"> mean</span><span begin="01:38.500" end="01:38.850"> it</span><span begin="01:38.950" end="01:39.170"> when</span><span begin="01:39.200" end="01:39.290"> we</span><span begin="01:39.310" end="01:39.570"> said</span><span begin="01:39.620" end="01:41.120"> forever?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.220" end="01:49.220"><span begin="01:41.220" end="01:41.940">Oh,</span><span begin="01:43.970" end="01:44.320"> this</span><span begin="01:44.350" end="01:44.680"> love</span><span begin="01:44.740" end="01:44.870"> is</span><span begin="01:44.940" end="01:46.440"> fadin'</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.360" end="01:55.300"><span begin="01:49.360" end="01:51.590">So</span><span begin="01:51.700" end="01:52.050"> much</span><span begin="01:52.230" end="01:52.610"> we're</span><span begin="01:52.790" end="01:53.070"> not</span><span begin="01:53.300" end="01:54.800"> sayin'</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.300" end="01:58.090"><span begin="01:55.300" end="01:55.360">But</span><span begin="01:55.380" end="01:55.420"> if</span><span begin="01:55.470" end="01:55.890"> these</span><span begin="01:56.180" end="01:56.600"> walls</span><span begin="01:56.660" end="01:56.950"> could</span><span begin="01:56.990" end="01:58.090"> talk</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.090" end="01:59.950"><span begin="01:58.090" end="01:58.320">(They'd</span><span begin="01:58.350" end="01:58.750"> say)</span><span begin="01:58.830" end="01:59.950"> "Enough"</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.950" end="02:02.480"><span begin="01:59.950" end="02:00.140">(They'd</span><span begin="02:00.170" end="02:00.370"> say)</span><span begin="02:00.740" end="02:00.860"> "Give</span><span begin="02:00.880" end="02:02.380"> up"</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.480" end="02:05.690"><span begin="02:02.480" end="02:02.570">(I</span><span begin="02:02.620" end="02:03.510"> know)</span><span begin="02:03.550" end="02:03.630"> if</span><span begin="02:03.670" end="02:04.130"> these</span><span begin="02:04.270" end="02:04.720"> walls</span><span begin="02:04.820" end="02:05.110"> could</span><span begin="02:05.210" end="02:05.710"> talk</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.690" end="02:07.350"><span begin="02:05.690" end="02:05.950">(They'd</span><span begin="02:06.000" end="02:06.630"> say)</span><span begin="02:06.680" end="02:06.910"> "You</span><span begin="02:06.940" end="02:07.440"> know"</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.350" end="02:09.740"><span begin="02:07.350" end="02:07.650">(They'd</span><span begin="02:07.690" end="02:08.070"> say)</span><span begin="02:08.360" end="02:08.500"> "You</span><span begin="02:08.530" end="02:09.740"> lost"</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.740" end="02:14.540"><span begin="02:09.740" end="02:09.840">It's</span><span begin="02:09.880" end="02:09.940"> not</span><span begin="02:09.990" end="02:10.770"> supposed</span><span begin="02:10.800" end="02:10.930"> to</span><span begin="02:11.010" end="02:11.420"> hurt</span><span begin="02:11.490" end="02:11.800"> this</span><span begin="02:11.900" end="02:13.400"> much</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.540" end="02:18.140"><span begin="02:14.540" end="02:14.660">Oh,</span><span begin="02:14.750" end="02:14.890"> if</span><span begin="02:14.970" end="02:15.410"> these</span><span begin="02:15.490" end="02:15.820"> walls</span><span begin="02:15.930" end="02:16.270"> could</span><span begin="02:16.340" end="02:17.840"> talk</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.140" end="02:21.440"><span begin="02:18.140" end="02:18.500">They'd</span><span begin="02:18.520" end="02:18.780"> tell</span><span begin="02:18.890" end="02:19.170"> us</span><span begin="02:19.300" end="02:19.580"> to</span><span begin="02:19.670" end="02:20.210"> break</span><span begin="02:20.270" end="02:21.440"> up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.440" end="02:25.080" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background"><span begin="02:21.440" end="02:21.560">(These</span><span begin="02:21.590" end="02:22.050"> walls,</span><span begin="02:22.090" end="02:22.590"> these</span><span begin="02:22.770" end="02:24.270"> walls)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.080" end="02:29.040"><span begin="02:25.080" end="02:25.760">(These</span><span begin="02:25.830" end="02:26.840"> walls)</span><span begin="02:26.860" end="02:27.270"> they'd</span><span begin="02:27.320" end="02:27.740"> tell</span><span begin="02:27.900" end="02:28.070"> us</span><span begin="02:28.140" end="02:28.300"> to</span><span begin="02:28.430" end="0